; An external centerline with no *fix of its own and no station name the
; parent driver shares. The *begin wrap the exporter puts around the
; *include keeps its names out of the cave's namespace, so nothing can
; reach it: cavern warns "Survey not all connected to fixed stations" and
; then drops the whole survey, which is why these stations never reach the
; .3d and the scan has to read this file on its own to learn their names.
*begin Hanging
*data normal from to tape compass clino
h1 h2 7.0 0 0
h2 h3 4.0 90 0
*end Hanging
